dy":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.5.1.stable.official [f62fdbde1], v4.6.dev6.official [dec5a373d]\n\n### System information\n\nmacOS Sequoia (15.7.2) - Godot Engine v4.5.1.stable.official\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen using FileDialog with `Use Native Dialog` enabled, saving a file with a `*.tres` filter appends a `.res` suffix to the filename(i.e. `filename` becomes `filename.res.tres`)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Add a FileDialog node then toggle its visibility so it's hidden, then add a filter and call the dialog via\n```gdscript\n\t$FileDialog.access = FileDialog.ACCESS_FILESYSTEM\n\t$FileDialog.file_mode = FileDialog.FILE_MODE_SAVE_FILE\n\t$FileDialog.add_filter(\"*.tres\")\n\t$FileDialog.show()\n```\n2. Connect the `file_selected` signal so it prints the resulting filepath to the console\n\n3. Run the project and attempt to save a file, notice that it adds `.res` suffix if `.tres` is used as a filter, other than that it works as expected:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8cce87b8-bd79-40cf-a966-94a4fda8298a\n\n\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[native-filedialog-suffix.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/23989301/native-filedialog-suffix.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/R